# Admin shell

- Class names and nested SCSS follow the component styles rule. Tokens (`$color-*`, `$shadow-*`, `$sidebar-w`) and `math-rem()` come from `assets/styles` in this package, and from `@use "katecms/styles"` in the form and SEO addons.
- Admin SFCs live in `runtime/internal/**`. `addAdminComponents` registers them with the `KateCms` prefix. Do not add them to the host `components` config.
- Field `type` maps to `internal/fields/{Pascal}Field.vue` through `resolveField()` (`image_select` to `ImageSelectField.vue`). Add the widget there and the config type in `@katecms/core`.
- Host-facing form widgets live in `katecms-form/src/runtime/components` (`addComponentsDir`).
- Addons add menu items through `useKateCmsMenuItems`, collection-entry sidebar tabs through `registerKateCmsEntrySidebarTab`, and dictionary term panels through `useKateCmsTermPanels`. Import them from `katecms/extensions`. The entry form owns the "Page" tab; an addon registers its own tab and component.
